Found in the skeid #44 type audit. /api/chat and /api/generate render route/admission/upstream errors via _render_error in the OpenAI envelope {error:{message,type}}. Ollama answers errors as {"error":"<message>"} (a string); the Go api client decodes StatusError.ErrorMessage as a string and a typed client fails on the object. Only the Invalid JSON body 400 in _handle_ollama is Ollama-shaped today. Fix mirrors core karr #224 for Anthropic: stash skeid.error_format => ollama on both routes, _render_error emits {error => $message}. t/54 currently pins $res->json->{error}{type} eq permission_error on /api/generate and must be changed deliberately.

